msgid ""
"Breakpoint list\n"
"\n"
"Displays a list of breakpoints with their current status. Clicking on a "
"breakpoint item with the right mouse button displays a popup menu so you may "
"manipulate the breakpoint. Double clicking will take you to the source in "
"the editor window."
